WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:03.200
My lady remembered to bring Xu'er to pay respects

00:03.920 --> 00:05.320
You're thoughtful

00:08.600 --> 00:09.440
Father

00:09.520 --> 00:10.960
Mother comes here every year

00:11.040 --> 00:12.880
Just rarely meets with Father

00:14.440 --> 00:15.840
Well done

00:16.280 --> 00:17.680
I will reward you

00:17.880 --> 00:19.280
What do you want?

